{'symbol': 'CTLT', 'date': '2023-03-02 18:00:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ACTION NOTICE: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN CATALENT, INC. WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CA / ACCESSWIRE / MARCH 2, 2023 / THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST CATALENT, INC. ("CATALENT" OR "THE COMPANY") (NYSE:CTLT) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION. INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED THE COMPANY\'S SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 30, 2021 AND OCTOBER 31, 2022, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM BEFORE APRIL 25, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'CTLT', 'date': '2023-03-02 14:35:00', 'title': 'CATALENT, INC. (CTLT) SHAREHOLDER ALERT: ROBBINS LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE IN CLASS ACTION AGAINST CATALENT, INC.', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $CTLT #CTLT--CATALENT, INC.'}{'symbol': 'CTLT', 'date': '2023-03-02 11:00:00', 'title': 'GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP, A LEADING SECURITIES FRAUD LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION ON BEHALF OF CATALENT, INC. (CTLT) INVESTORS', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP (“GPM”), A LEADING NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CATALENT, INC. (“CATALENT” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: CTLT) SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 30, 2021 AND OCTOBER 31, 2022, INCLUSIVE (THE “CLASS PERIOD”). CATALENT INVESTORS HAVE UNTIL APRIL 25, 2023 TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION.'}{'symbol': 'CTLT', 'date': '2023-03-02 05:45:00', 'title': 'CTLT LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES CATALENT, INC. INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MARCH 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN CATALENT, INC. ("CATALENT" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: CTLT) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF CATALENT INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD BETWEEN AUGUST 30, 2021 AND OCTOBER 31, 2022.'}